{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>This people.</b> Wherever זו is said, it is in place of אשר. So too זו חטאנו. And it means: the people whom You redeemed." "<b>To Your holy habitation.</b> The entire Land of Israel He calls 'holy habitation,' as in ויביאם אל גבול קדשו הר זה קנתה ימינו. And so too מאספיו וגו׳ — He equates it in חצרות קדשי." "<b>נחית. נהלת.</b> Past tense in form of future, for such is the language of prophecies and songs."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:01.485235154Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}